{"title": "India Celebrates 80th Independence Day with PM Modi's Address", "summary": "India marked its 80th Independence Day with Prime Minister Narendra Modi addressing the nation from the Red Fort. The Prime Minister extended greetings and emphasized the importance of 'Yuva Shakti' (youth power) and 'Viksit Bharat' (developed India), calling for self-reliance. Singer Adnan Sami also drew an emotional connection between the national celebration and his birthday.", "summary_points": ["India observed its 80th Independence Day.", "Prime Minister Narendra Modi addressed the nation from the Red Fort.", "Modi highlighted 'Yuva Shakti' and 'Viksit Bharat' in his speech.", "The Prime Minister called for self-reliance.", "Singer Adnan Sami noted an emotional link between Independence Day and his birthday."], "title_hi": "भारत ने पीएम मोदी के संबोधन के साथ 80वां स्वतंत्रता दिवस मनाया", "summary_hi": "भारत ने अपना 80वां स्वतंत्रता दिवस मनाया, जिसमें प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी ने लाल किले से राष्ट्र को संबोधित किया। प्रधानमंत्री ने शुभकामनाएं दीं और 'युवा शक्ति' तथा 'विकसित भारत' के महत्व पर जोर दिया, आत्मनिर्भरता का आह्वान किया। गायक अदनान सामी ने राष्ट्रीय उत्सव और उनके जन्मदिन के बीच एक भावनात्मक संबंध भी जोड़ा।", "summary_points_hi": ["भारत ने अपना 80वां स्वतंत्रता दिवस मनाया।", "प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी ने लाल किले से राष्ट्र को संबोधित किया।", "मोदी ने अपने भाषण में 'युवा शक्ति' और 'विकसित भारत' पर प्रकाश डाला।", "प्रधानमंत्री ने आत्मनिर्भरता का आह्वान किया।", "गायक अदनान सामी ने स्वतंत्रता दिवस और उनके जन्मदिन के बीच एक भावनात्मक संबंध बताया।"], "framing": {"center": ["Reported on Prime Minister Narendra Modi's address from the Red Fort on the 80th Independence Day.", "Noted the Prime Minister's emphasis on 'Yuva Shakti' and 'Viksit Bharat'.", "Included singer Adnan Sami's personal reflection linking Independence Day and his birthday."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["80वें स्वतंत्रता दिवस पर लाल किले से प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी के संबोधन पर रिपोर्ट किया।", "प्रधानमंत्री के 'युवा शक्ति' और 'विकसित भारत' पर जोर देने का उल्लेख किया।", "गायक अदनान सामी के स्वतंत्रता दिवस और उनके जन्मदिन को जोड़ने वाले व्यक्तिगत विचार को शामिल किया।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://dam.mediacorp.sg/image/upload/s--96pMMRuL--/c_fill,g_auto,h_338,w_600/f_auto,q_auto/v1/mediacorp/cna/image/2026/08/15/1786799532-image.jpg?itok=n3nn45TG", "sources": [{"source": "Outlook India", "owner": "Outlook India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Adnan Sami Draws An Emotional Link Between India's Independence Day And His Birthday"}, {"source": "The Statesman", "owner": "The Statesman", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Independence Day 2026 LIVE: PM Modi to address nation from Red Fort as India marks 80th Independence Day"}, {"source": "Times Now", "owner": "Times Now", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "PM Modi Greets Nation on 80th Independence Day; Highlights Yuva Shakti, Viksit Bharat | WATCH"}, {"source": "Channel News Asia", "owner": "Channel News Asia", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/watch/india-independence-day-pm-narendra-modi-pushes-self-reliance-in-his-address-nation-6321441", "headline": "India Independence Day : PM Narendra Modi pushes for self - reliance in his address to the nation"}, {"source": "Channel News Asia", "owner": "Channel News Asia", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOcU85QmtLNkdpSllWLVpsRXJUWlBxei1QUXpTQy1YcVEtNEdENUdYWTFtcEdUbWsyY0NGUE5GTWNTbWp1cm5SbTlkQWU4a3BDMUNzd0JlMzRKOXQzdVRuVlpFdHpHbUVuZlo3YXpUUmZzNHlpZTB6N2xrcXZ0OG52LXNGdHZfelFLSWFuZDhGN1RFTnJncFh5RFp6S0lYQk5qRzlpVkE2RTMzT0hjdWtrdVNPaUpzckhXckFsQjBIV29TX2F5MURz?oc=5", "headline": "India Independence Day: PM Narendra Modi pushes for self-reliance in his address 